    <div>
    <pb n="1" facs="gb:digitalisate#10920/22380"/>
      <p>
        <anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR128_0_075_011"/>Ich wills überwinden und <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR128_0_note_001_75_11" xml:id="start_com_1183"/>Sie heut nicht sehn<ref xml:id="end_com_1183"/>, wenn’s hält biss Abend. 
<anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR128_0_075_012"/>Hier <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR128_0_note_002_75_12" xml:id="start_com_1184"/>die Stücke<ref xml:id="end_com_1184"/>, das ─ <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR128_0_note_003_75_12" xml:id="start_com_1185"/>Portefeuille<ref xml:id="end_com_1185"/>, <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR128_0_note_004_75_12" xml:id="start_com_1186"/>die Muschel<ref xml:id="end_com_1186"/> – – Was brauch ich 
<anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR128_0_075_013"/>mehr zu sagen. <ref target="gb:note#GB03_2_BR128_0_note_005_75_13" xml:id="start_com_1187"/>Sie wissen alles.<ref xml:id="end_com_1187"/>    d<g ref="#typoSuspension"/>. 13 Jun. 76</p>
      <closer>
        <anchor xml:id="GB03_1_BR128_0_075_014"/>
        <signed rend="paraph" rendition="#einrueck23">G.</signed>
      </closer>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>


